('MEAL-021', 'وعاء ريكوتا بالتفاح والقرفة مع الموز والتوت الأزرق', 'Apple-Cinnamon Ricotta Bowl with Banana and Blueberries', 'وعاء فطور مرتفع الطاقة من الريكوتا مع كميات مدروسة من الموز والتفاح والتوت الأزرق والشيا. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A higher-energy ricotta breakfast bowl with measured banana, apple, blueberries and chia. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_fiber','omega_3']::text[], ARRAY['milk']::text[], 516.0, 25.0, 60.1, 19.5, 427.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['ضع كمية الريكوتا المحددة في وعاء الفطور.','رتّب الموز والتفاح والتوت الأزرق فوق الريكوتا في حصص ظاهرة ومنفصلة.','أكمل ببذور الشيا والقرفة بالكميات المحددة وقدّم الوعاء كاملًا كحصة واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Spoon the measured ricotta into a breakfast bowl.','Arrange the banana, apple and blueberries over the ricotta in visibly separate portions.','Finish with the measured chia and cinnamon; serve the complete bowl as one portion.']::text[], 10, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-021/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-021/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-021.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'وعاء ريكوتا بالتفاح والقرفة مع الموز والتوت الأزرق', 'Apple-Cinnamon Ricotta Bowl with Banana and Blueberries', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"450_599","protein_band_g":"20_29","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":495.7,"macro_energy_kcal":516.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":3.93,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":495.7,"published_macro_energy_kcal":516.0,"energy_delta_pct":3.93,"derived_fiber_g":12.0,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pa