('MEAL-022', 'وعاء زبادي يوناني بالمانجو والزنجبيل مع التفاح والجوز', 'Mango-Ginger Greek Yogurt Bowl with Apple and Walnuts', 'وعاء زبادي يوناني عالي الحجم مع التفاح والبرتقال والمانجو والجوز والزنجبيل الطازج. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A high-volume Greek-yogurt bowl with apple, orange, mango, walnuts and fresh ginger. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_fiber','omega_3']::text[], ARRAY['milk','tree_nuts']::text[], 402.0, 25.0, 51.0, 10.9, 543.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['ضع الزبادي اليوناني في وعاء فطور عريض.','رتّب كميات التفاح والبرتقال والمانجو المحددة فوق الزبادي.','أضف الجوز والزنجبيل المبشور ناعمًا وقدّم الوعاء عالي الحجم كاملًا كحصة واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Spoon the Greek yogurt into a wide breakfast bowl.','Arrange the measured apple, orange and mango over the yogurt.','Add the walnuts and finely grated ginger; serve the complete high-volume bowl as one portion.']::text[], 8, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-022/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-022/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-022.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'وعاء زبادي يوناني بالمانجو والزنجبيل مع التفاح والجوز', 'Mango-Ginger Greek Yogurt Bowl with Apple and Walnuts', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"300_449","protein_band_g":"20_29","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"moderate","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":387.8,"macro_energy_kcal":402.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":3.53,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":387.8,"published_macro_energy_kcal":402.0,"energy_delta_pct":3.53,"derived_fiber_g":8.4,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitabilit