('MEAL-035', 'وعاء ريكوتا بالبرتقال وبذور الكتان مع الموز واللوز', 'Orange-Flax Ricotta Bowl with Banana and Almonds', 'وعاء ريكوتا داعم للبروتين مع البرتقال والتفاح والموز واللوز وبذور الكتان. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A protein-supportive ricotta bowl with orange, apple, banana, almonds and flaxseed. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_fiber','omega_3']::text[], ARRAY['milk','tree_nuts']::text[], 449.0, 25.1, 36.5, 22.5, 357.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['ضع كمية الريكوتا المحددة في وعاء الفطور.','رتّب البرتقال والتفاح وكمية الموز الصغيرة فوق الريكوتا.','أكمل باللوز وبذور الكتان وقدّم وعاءً كاملًا واحدًا.']::text[], ARRAY['Spoon the measured ricotta into a breakfast bowl.','Arrange the orange, apple and small banana portion over the ricotta.','Finish with almonds and flaxseed and serve one complete bowl.']::text[], 8, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-035/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-035/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-035.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'وعاء ريكوتا بالبرتقال وبذور الكتان مع الموز واللوز', 'Orange-Flax Ricotta Bowl with Banana and Almonds', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"300_449","protein_band_g":"20_29","carb_band_g":"moderate","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":436.5,"macro_energy_kcal":449.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":2.78,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":436.5,"published_macro_energy_kcal":449.0,"energy_delta_pct":2.78,"derived_fiber_g":7.1,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 35),
('MEAL-036', 'وعاء ريكوتا بالبرتقال وبذور الكتان مع التمر والتفاح', 'Orange-Flax Ricotta Bowl with Dates and Apple', 'وعاء ريكوتا مرتفع الطاقة مع كمية تمر واضحة ومحددة والبرتقال والتفاح وبذور الكتان. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A higher-energy ricotta bowl with a substantial measured date portion, orange, apple and flaxseed. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_fiber','omega_3']::text[], ARRAY['milk']::text[], 632.0, 25.0, 88.9, 19.6, 402.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['ضع الريكوتا في وعاء الفطور.','رتّب التمر والبرتقال والتفاح فوق الريكوتا وفق النسب المحددة.','رش بذور الكتان وقدّم الوعاء كاملًا.']::text[], ARRAY['Spoon the ricotta into a breakfast bowl.','Arrange the dates, orange and apple over the ricotta in their measured proportions.','Sprinkle with flaxseed and serve the complete bowl.']::text[], 8, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-036/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-036/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-036.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'وعاء ريكوتا بالبرتقال وبذور الكتان مع التمر والتفاح', 'Orange-Flax Ricotta Bowl with Dates and Apple', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"600_plus","protein_band_g":"20_29","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":600.2,"macro_energy_kcal":632.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":5.03,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":600.2,"published_macro_energy_kcal":632.0,"energy_delta_pct":5.03,"derived_fiber_g":11.8,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 36),
('MEAL-037', 'هاش فطور بالتوفو والبطاطا الحلوة مع الكرنب الأجعد', 'Tofu Sweet Potato Breakfast Hash with Kale', 'هاش فطور نباتي أعيد تصميمه جذريًا من التوفو والبطاطا الحلوة والكرنب الأجعد والفلفل الأحمر والأفوكادو. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A materially redesigned plant breakfast hash with tofu, sweet potato, kale, red pepper and avocado. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','vegan','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_protein','high_fiber']::text[], ARRAY['soy']::text[], 495.0, 32.5, 48.2, 19.1, 470.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['سخّن التوفو والبطاطا الحلوة المشوية في مقلاة غير لاصقة حتى يتحمرا قليلًا.','أضف الكرنب الأجعد والفلفل الأحمر واطهُ الخليط حتى يسخن بالكامل.','أكمل بالكمون وعصير الليمون الأخضر والأفوكادو بالكمية المحددة وقدّم حصة هاش واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Warm the tofu and baked sweet potato in a nonstick skillet until lightly browned.','Fold in the kale and red pepper and cook until hot throughout.','Finish with cumin, lime juice and the measured avocado and serve one hash portion.']::text[], 20, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-037/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-037/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-037.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'هاش فطور بالتوفو والبطاطا الحلوة مع الكرنب الأجعد', 'Tofu Sweet Potato Breakfast Hash with Kale', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"450_599","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"moderate","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":454.7,"macro_energy_kcal":495.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":8.14,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":454.7,"published_macro_energy_kcal":495.0,"energy_delta_pct":8.14,"derived_fiber_g":14.6,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 37),
('MEAL-038', 'توست بجبن القريش والليمون والأعشاب مع الطماطم والسبانخ', 'Lemon-Herb Cottage Cheese Toast with Tomato and Spinach', 'توست قمح كامل مفتوح مغطى بجبن القريش والطماطم والسبانخ وزيت الليمون والبقدونس. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'Open whole-wheat toast topped with cottage cheese, tomato, spinach and lemon-parsley oil. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','high_protein','high_fiber']::text[], ARRAY['milk','gluten']::text[], 535.0, 36.9, 55.3, 18.5, 475.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['حمّص خبز القمح الكامل حتى يصبح مقرمشًا وضع الشرائح مفتوحة في الطبق.','وزّع جبن القريش فوق التوست وأضف السبانخ الدافئة والطماطم الطازجة.','اخلط زيت الزيتون مع عصير الليمون والبقدونس ووزّعه فوق التوست المفتوح ثم قدّم حصة واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Toast the whole-wheat bread until crisp and place the slices open on a plate.','Spread the cottage cheese over the toast and top with the warm spinach and fresh tomato.','Mix the olive oil with lemon juice and parsley, drizzle it over the open toast and serve one portion.']::text[], 15, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-038/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-038/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-038.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'توست بجبن القريش والليمون والأعشاب مع الطماطم والسبانخ', 'Lemon-Herb Cottage Cheese Toast with Tomato and Spinach', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"450_599","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":525.6,"macro_energy_kcal":535.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":1.76,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":525.6,"published_macro_energy_kcal":535.0,"energy_delta_pct":1.76,"derived_fiber_g":8.0,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 38),
('MEAL-039', 'تاكو فطور بالتوفو والفاصوليا السوداء والكمون والليمون الأخضر', 'Cumin-Lime Tofu and Black Bean Breakfast Tacos', 'قطعتا تاكو من تورتيلا الذرة للفطور مع التوفو والفاصوليا السوداء والطماطم والأفوكادو. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'Two corn-tortilla breakfast tacos with tofu, black beans, tomato and avocado. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','vegan','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_protein','high_fiber']::text[], ARRAY['soy']::text[], 467.0, 30.3, 54.4, 14.2, 340.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['سخّن تورتيلا الذرة واتركها مفتوحة في طبق التقديم.','سخّن التوفو والفاصوليا السوداء مع الكمون ثم وزّع الخليط بين قطع التورتيلا.','أضف الطماطم والأفوكادو وأكمل بعصير الليمون الأخضر وقدّم قطعتي التاكو كحصة واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Warm the corn tortillas and keep them open on a serving plate.','Warm the tofu and black beans with cumin, then divide the mixture between the tortillas.','Top with tomato and avocado, finish with lime juice and serve the two tacos as one portion.']::text[], 20, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-039/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-039/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-039.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'تاكو فطور بالتوفو والفاصوليا السوداء والكمون والليمون الأخضر', 'Cumin-Lime Tofu and Black Bean Breakfast Tacos', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"450_599","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"moderate","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":437.3,"macro_energy_kcal":467.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":6.36,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":437.3,"published_macro_energy_kcal":467.0,"energy_delta_pct":6.36,"derived_fiber_g":16.5,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 39),
('MEAL-040', 'وعاء كينوا بالزبادي اليوناني والمانجو والزنجبيل مع الجوز', 'Mango-Ginger Greek Yogurt Quinoa Bowl with Walnuts', 'وعاء فطور حلو ومتجانس من الزبادي اليوناني والكينوا والمانجو والجوز والشيا والزنجبيل. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A coherent sweet breakfast bowl with Greek yogurt, quinoa, mango, walnuts, chia and ginger. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_protein','high_fiber','omega_3']::text[], ARRAY['milk','tree_nuts']::text[], 527.0, 30.4, 57.4, 19.5, 465.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['برّد الكينوا المطهوة ثم أضفها إلى الزبادي اليوناني برفق.','أضف المانجو والزنجبيل المبشور ناعمًا بالكميات المحددة.','أكمل بالجوز وبذور الشيا وقدّم الوعاء كاملًا باردًا.']::text[], ARRAY['Cool the cooked quinoa, then fold it into the Greek yogurt.','Add the measured mango and finely grated ginger.','Finish with walnuts and chia and serve the complete bowl chilled.']::text[], 10, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-040/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-040/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-040.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'وعاء كينوا بالزبادي اليوناني والمانجو والزنجبيل مع الجوز', 'Mango-Ginger Greek Yogurt Quinoa Bowl with Walnuts', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"450_599","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"high","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":507.4,"macro_energy_kcal":527.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":3.72,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":507.4,"published_macro_energy_kcal":527.0,"energy_delta_pct":3.72,"derived_fiber_g":10.5,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bili