('MEAL-047', 'شوفان مطهو ببياض البيض والتوت والشيا', 'Cooked Berry-Chia Egg White Oats', 'وعاء شوفان عالي البروتين ومطهو بالكامل مع بياض البيض والتوت الأزرق واللوز والشيا. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A fully cooked high-protein oat bowl with egg white, blueberries, almonds and chia. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','high_protein']::text[], ARRAY['egg','tree_nuts']::text[], 302.0, 31.0, 22.1, 9.9, 303.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['اطهُ الشوفان حتى يلين ويغلي برفق.','أضف بياض البيض تدريجيًا مع التحريك المستمر حتى يصبح معتمًا تمامًا وتصل حرارته الداخلية إلى 74°م (165°ف).','أضف التوت الأزرق واللوز وبذور الشيا وقدّم فورًا.']::text[], ARRAY['Cook the oats until tender and gently simmering.','Whisk in the egg whites gradually and cook, stirring continuously, until fully opaque and the center reaches 74°C (165°F).','Top with blueberries, almonds and chia and serve immediately.']::text[], 12, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-047/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-047/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-047.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'شوفان مطهو ببياض البيض والتوت والشيا', 'Cooked Berry-Chia Egg White Oats', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"300_449","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"low","fat_band_g":"moderate","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":300.7,"macro_energy_kcal":302.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":0.43,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":300.7,"published_macro_energy_kcal":302.0,"energy_delta_pct":0.43,"derived_fiber_g":5.4,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 47),
('MEAL-048', 'تاكو ذرة بجبن القريش والطماطم والبقدونس', 'Tomato-Parsley Cottage Cheese Corn Tacos', 'قطعتا تاكو مفتوحتان من تورتيلا الذرة مع جبن القريش والخس الروماني والكرنب الأجعد وزيت الطماطم والبقدونس. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'Two open corn-tortilla tacos with cottage cheese, romaine, kale and tomato-parsley oil. Values are for one serving.', 'breakfast'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance']::text[], ARRAY['vegetarian','pescatarian','gluten_free','high_fiber']::text[], ARRAY['milk']::text[], 448.0, 15.1, 41.2, 24.7, 316.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['سخّن تورتيلا الذرة وضع القطعتين مفتوحتين في طبق واحد.','وزّع جبن القريش والخس الروماني والكرنب الأجعد بين قطع التورتيلا.','اخلط زيت الزيتون مع الطماطم والبقدونس بالكميات المحددة ووزّعه فوق التاكو ثم قدّم حصة واحدة.']::text[], ARRAY['Warm the corn tortillas and place the two tortillas open on one plate.','Divide the cottage cheese, romaine and kale between the tortillas.','Mix the olive oil with the measured tomato and parsley, spoon it over the tacos and serve one portion.']::text[], 15, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-048/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-048/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-048.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'تاكو ذرة بجبن القريش والطماطم والبقدونس', 'Tomato-Parsley Cottage Cheese Corn Tacos', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"300_449","protein_band_g":"under_20","carb_band_g":"moderate","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":430.1,"macro_energy_kcal":448.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":4.0,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":430.1,"published_macro_energy_kcal":448.0,"energy_delta_pct":4.0,"derived_fiber_g":8.4,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_sui