('MEAL-057', 'طبق غداء بلحم الضأن والبرغل مع الكمون والليمون الأخضر', 'Cumin-Lime Lamb and Bulgur Lunch Plate', 'طبق غداء مدمج وعالي البروتين من لحم الضأن مع البرغل والسبانخ واللوز. القيم لحصة واحدة.', 'A compact high-protein lamb lunch plate with bulgur, spinach and almonds. Values are for one serving.', 'lunch'::public.meal_type, ARRAY['fat_loss','maintenance','muscle_gain']::text[], ARRAY['high_protein','high_fiber']::text[], ARRAY['gluten','tree_nuts']::text[], 445.0, 36.0, 26.2, 21.8, 260.0, 'g', 1, ARRAY['سخّن لحم الضأن المشوي والبرغل والسبانخ حتى تسخن بالكامل.','رتّب لحم الضأن والبرغل كمكوّنين متساويين بالكمية مع السبانخ إلى جانبهما.','أكمل باللوز والكمون وعصير الليمون الأخضر وقدّم طبق غداء واحدًا.']::text[], ARRAY['Warm the roasted lamb, bulgur and spinach until hot throughout.','Arrange the lamb and bulgur as equal measured components with the spinach beside them.','Finish with almonds, cumin and lime juice and serve one lunch plate.']::text[], 20, '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-057/cover.webp', '/nutrition/meals/MEAL-057/cover-thumb.webp', 'images/MEAL-057.png', 'ready'::public.meal_image_status, 'طبق غداء بلحم الضأن والبرغل مع الكمون والليمون الأخضر', 'Cumin-Lime Lamb and Bulgur Lunch Plate', 'published'::public.meal_library_status, 'ready', 'Nutrition Library V2. USDA FoodData Central. One serving. Identity is external_id.', '{"calorie_band_kcal":"300_449","protein_band_g":"30_39","carb_band_g":"moderate","fat_band_g":"high","meal_type_required":true,"max_calorie_delta_pct":10,"max_protein_delta_g":8,"exclude_allergens":true}'::jsonb, '{"ingredient_energy_kcal":429.1,"macro_energy_kcal":445.0,"macro_vs_ingredient_delta_pct":3.57,"macro_formula":"protein_g*4 + carbs_g*4 + fat_g*9","source_energy_kcal":429.1,"published_macro_energy_kcal":445.0,"energy_delta_pct":3.57,"derived_fiber_g":9.0,"nutrition_check":"pass","ingredient_check":"pass","allergen_check":"pass","dietary_tag_check":"pass","goal_suitability_check":"pass","bilingual_check":"pass"}'::jsonb, TRUE, 57)